ive/editorial-pack.zip.\", \"Reopen edited copies and verify both corrected and protected passages.\", \"Store a concise session memory with verified output paths, official source URLs, and one source-bound finding.\"], \"criteria_authority\": \"planner_claim\", \"result\": {\"status\": \"observed_unverified\", \"reason\": \"One input observed; no effect predicate or progress verified\", \"ui_state_receipt\": {\"schema\": \"robit.omni.ui-state-receipt.v1\", \"session_id\": \"eb592ded16cbfde46dba7e986fc932f0e3c5bcf9fbec2874dc879d3d0fc4fc78\", \"scope_id\": \"atspi:8ea9e5659382102f4c5c2ebea11098f2\", \"revision\": \"7bd88e4f2b8e373868753b7850984fce34f6c86530f7f1b49df790806354c042\", \"resource\": \"atspi:8ea9e5659382102f4c5c2ebea11098f2\"}, \"effect_receipt\": {\"schema\": \"robit.omni.ui-effect-receipt.v1\", \"effect_state\": \"unknown\", \"environment_may_have_changed\": true}, \"ui_boundary_receipt\": {\"schema\": \"robit.omni.ui-boundary.v1\", \"verified\": false, \"input_attempted\": true, \"cached\": false, \"observed\": true, \"adapter_called\": true, \"environment_may_have_changed\": true, \"task_progress\": false, \"new_effect_count\": 0, \"novelty_key\": \"cb64a92c28a1236bdd48dfe1820ada142b27b3090ea145fcb7023cce50f78c2a\", \"before_semantic_revision\": \"d71ff17c61d9c7bd870d9fe951c1f80174833f3d1c442d9d56bf85f95199dc65\", \"after_semantic_revision\": \"7bd88e4f2b8e373868753b7850984fce34f6c86530f7f1b49df790806354c042\"}, \"pointer_recovery_receipt\": {\"schema\": \"robit.omni.pointer-recovery.v1\", \"reference\": \"11beecd9d5e44ba3a1f0bbeea1a7ddc7\", \"policy_receipt_id\": \"e396f92a37e94d758525a37acca9baf1\", \"selected_by\": \"omni_phase_planner\", \"input_authority\": false, \"effect\": \"unknown\"}}, \"planner_assessment\": {\"source_epoch\": \"b58db29d3ad94459bad26b6c8615b8d3\", \"source_phase\": 4, \"decision\": \"recover\", \"summary\": \"Fast policy abstained. Unverified planner prediction: The Workbench file list expands to show the five declared item